## Summary
Cloudflare has transformed its CI pipelines into TypeScript-based workflows to enhance development processes. This change likely improves type safety, maintainability, and developer experience. The approach showcases the integration of TypeScript in DevOps practices.

## Key Points
- Cloudflare adopted TypeScript to modernize CI pipelines, focusing on workflow automation.
- TypeScript offers type safety and better tooling, potentially reducing errors in development.
- This transformation may set a precedent for using TypeScript in DevOps environments.


